# Bash allow rules the installer owns in the project's settings.local.json (one per line).
# {bin_scripts} expands to one `Bash(<name> *)` and one `Bash(<name>)` line per script in the
# release's bin/ (the plugin's bin/ is on the Bash PATH, so agents call them by bare name).
{bin_scripts}
Bash(kourai-config *)
Bash(kourai-project *)
